# A bond the city owes is a card in the look of the game's loan cards: a name box on top, the
# loan-style fields, Total and Pay Now bottom right. A large bond's values must not run under the
# button, and the name the player types is kept. Sells one ₡1,500,000 5-year bond against fixed
# finances and repays it in cleanup (a few cents of interest at most).
name bond card: fields clear the Repay button and the bond keeps the name typed for it
show-economy loans
bonds-section show
bond-finances 0 1,000,000
bonds-term 5
bonds-amount 1,500,000
click FinanceOverhaulBondsSell
expect-log bonds: sold #
wait 0.8
expect-visible FinanceOverhaulBondsRow-$bond
expect-text-is FinanceOverhaulBondsValue-Amount-$bond ₡1,500,000
expect-text-is FinanceOverhaulBondsValue-Term-$bond 260 Weeks
expect-text-is FinanceOverhaulBondsValue-TimeLeft-$bond 260 Weeks
expect-text FinanceOverhaulBondsValue-WeeklyCost-$bond ₡
expect-text-is FinanceOverhaulBondsRepay-$bond Pay Now
expect-text FinanceOverhaulBondsValue-Total-$bond ₡1,500,000
expect-no-overlap FinanceOverhaulBondsValue-WeeklyCost-$bond FinanceOverhaulBondsRepay-$bond
expect-no-overlap FinanceOverhaulBondsValue-RepaidOn-$bond FinanceOverhaulBondsRepay-$bond
expect-no-overlap FinanceOverhaulBondsValue-TimeLeft-$bond FinanceOverhaulBondsRepay-$bond
expect-no-overlap FinanceOverhaulBondsValue-Total-$bond FinanceOverhaulBondsRepay-$bond
expect-no-overlap FinanceOverhaulBondsName-$bond FinanceOverhaulBondsRepay-$bond
expect-text FinanceOverhaulBondsName-$bond Bond #
capture bond-card
# typing replaces the default name; leaving the box keeps it
keys FinanceOverhaulBondsName-$bond H o s p i t a l
blur FinanceOverhaulBondsName-$bond
expect-log named 'Hospital'
wait 0.8
expect-text-is FinanceOverhaulBondsName-$bond Hospital
capture bond-card-named
# an emptied box goes back to the bond's number
keys FinanceOverhaulBondsName-$bond backspace
blur FinanceOverhaulBondsName-$bond
wait 0.8
expect-text FinanceOverhaulBondsName-$bond Bond #
cleanup:
redeem-new-bonds
bonds-section auto
close-economy
